{{Term/Store|Rhondson Armor Boutique||Series, BotW}} is an [[Armor Shop]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|Rhondson Armor Boutique|Sign|BotW}}</ref>

==Features and Overview==
Rhondson Armor Boutique is the local [[Armor Shop]] of [[Tarrey Town]]. After being unable to find work as a tailor in the [[Gerudo Desert]],<ref>{{Cite|I was hoping my craft would help me find a mate, but it doesn't seem like there's much work for a tailor around here.|Rhondson|BotW}}</ref> [[Rhondson]] moves to Tarrey Town during the "[[From the Ground Up]]" [[Side Quest]] and opens the Boutique.<ref>{{Cite|I hear she's decided to continue putting her skills to use by opening a {{Color BotW|Blue|clothing shop}}. You should stop by and say hello.|Hudson|BotW}}</ref> There, she sells the [[Desert Voe Set]]. Following his marriage to Rhondson, [[Hudson]] will join her at the Boutique.

If [[Link]] makes a purchase from the Rhondson Armor Boutique, Rhondson will thank him.<ref>{{Cite|Sarqso! It suits you.|Rhondson|BotW}}</ref> Should Link buy the entire Desert Voe Set, Rhondson will be grateful that her stock has been bought out.<ref>{{Cite|Oh! You bought everything! Sarqso.|Rhondson|BotW}}</ref>

